    "en": "Nine o'clock, a planned dressing change, the third this week. The prescription is clear and recent: the material, the interval and the compression are all written down. Herr Ferber has been coming for three weeks. Last time the pain was three out of ten; today he says seven — **and he says something that was not there before**."
