    "warum_en": "The documentation shows **a course, not a snapshot**: pain 3, then 5, then 7 with their dates, so the deterioration is visible without being explained away. And it separates what the patient noticed from what the nurse saw. And it records **the action with its time** — taken off at ten past nine, reported at a quarter past nine — and it states what will happen until the assessment. And there is no diagnosis in it, no self-justification, and no judgement about anyone.",
