    "en": "Eight o'clock, breakfast time. Frau Demir has been on the ward for twelve days. She can barely use her right hand, and she understands everything but finds words slowly. Her daughter comes every morning, and she is now cutting up the bread for her and putting it into her mouth. **And for four days Frau Demir has stopped going to the dining room.**"
