     "schritt_en": "Taking on the steering: for every measure, **who carries it out, by which sign it is known to be working, and when it is reviewed** — **and who is told if it stops being suitable before then**.",
     "sicherheit_en": "Without a sign that it works and a review date, a measure continues because it started. **And six weeks of a measure that is never reviewed is a routine with a signature on it.**"
