     "titel_en": "Integrated care after discharge",
     "text_en": "A chronically ill person after discharge is looked after by several parties who do not see one another: the family doctor, the community nursing service, the pharmacy, the relatives. Your task is not to replace them but to make sure **the same information reaches all of them** — above all the warning signs at which somebody must act, and who is to be called then.",
