     "name_en": "Naming the dilemma instead of translating it",
     "was_zaehlt_en": "It opens with the ethical question — whose will counts — not with the technical one. **Opening with “is the tube indicated” fails the criterion**, because it turns the dilemma back into a technical matter decided by one person.",
