     "name_en": "The allocation is a situation assessment, spoken aloud",
     "was_zaehlt_en": "Who is unstable today and why, **what is not split**, **what expressly stays with the registered nurse**, **and a meeting point with a time**. **A list of rooms and names alone fails the criterion.**",
